                        "local_path": "media/20260618_014324_2.jpg"
                    }
                ],
                "timestamp": "2026-06-18T01:43:24+00:00"
            },
            {
                "text": "they have a pitch matched transceiver array on the ASIC that is wafer bonded onto the CMUT array wafer..\nI wonder why they are averaging 8 channels, I guess otherwise it would have ~9k channels * 10 bit/sample * 40 MS/s = 3.6 Tb/s lol, getting close to blackwell's one-way nvlink bw.\n- Sanchez2021: [34.1 An 8960-Element Ultrasound-on-Chip for Point-of-Care Ultrasound](\nhttps://doi.org/10.1109/ISSCC42613.2021.9365808)",
                "media": [
                    {
