            {
                "text": "had no idea tsmc had a full slide on butterfly.\n[tsmc 2020 Corporate Social Responsibility Report](\nhttps://esg.tsmc.com/download/csr/2020-csr-report/english/pdf/e-role-1-innovationManagement.pdf)",
                "media": [
                    {
