                    }
                ],
                "timestamp": "2026-06-20T05:01:31+00:00"
            },
            {
                "text": "shrinking the ferrules so that you can fit three MMC connectors in the same footprint as one MPO connector\n- Childers2021: [A Novel, Low-loss, Multi-Fiber Connector with Increased Usable Fiber Density](\nhttps://www.usconec.com/media/hppftu5c/a-novel-low-loss-multi-fiber-connector-with-increased-usable-fiber-den_.pdf)",
                "media": [
