    {
        "url": "https://x.com/jwt0625/status/2070025936880513329",
        "tweets": [
            {
                "text": "I wish people read old works more. Look at this wild \"chip\" from 20 years ago, to be accurate it is an assembled 3D optical multilayer module.\nThey also called it Planar-integrated free-space optics (PIFSO)... It has multiple layers with embedded gratings and microlens, and got photodiodes and laser diodes on the two surfaces. Light would bounce around inside and go in and out of PCB integrated waveguides. Yeah you read it right, it was during the time where people were into optoelectronic PCB with polymer optical waveguides, so you get to see them working together!\nIt was funded by EU's High-speed OptoeLectronic Memory Systems (HOLMS) project, to run a JEPG2000\ndecoder on an optical processor-memory bus in a multiprocessor system lol.\none version of the future optical interconnects are gonna be built by AR glasses people, they dance with a lot of modes over a broad bandwidth.",
                "media": [
                    {
                        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLozLN1aUAA0Doe?format=jpg",
                        "local_path": "media/20260625_060657_0.jpg"
                    },
                    {
                        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLo0Sf0bsAEVeyD?format=jpg",
                        "local_path": "media/20260625_060657_1.jpg"
                    }
                ],
                "timestamp": "2026-06-25T06:06:57+00:00"
            },
            {
                "text": "this looks so damn fun and painful at the same time. The pictured chip above supports 192 channels.\naverage coupling efficiency about -8 dB.\n- Jarczynski2006: [Integrated three-dimensional optical multilayer using free-space optics](\nhttps://doi.org/10.1364/AO.45.006335)",
                "media": [
                    {
                        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLo13IHakAE0mnC?format=jpg",
                        "local_path": "media/20260625_061220_0.jpg"
                    },
                    {
                        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLo219SbwAAbMbK?format=jpg",
                        "local_path": "media/20260625_061220_1.jpg"
                    }
                ],
                "timestamp": "2026-06-25T06:12:20+00:00"
            }
        ]
    },
